                                                "sense_id": "806a080b-b4b0-310e-9028-2368f2af9696",
                                                "text": "I'm AC/DC and seek a gentle, full of energy, mid-30's gentleman who is also seekin companionship and knows the meaning of \"LIFE,\" and is able to share it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a446cc3-20ae-424c-b846-c5ff40ea61b5",
                                                "sense_id": "806a080b-b4b0-310e-9028-2368f2af9696",
                                                "text": "The woman had great difficulty explaining it. ‘You know, AC–DC,’ she kept repeating. Finally she said, ‘Swings both ways.’ ‘Oh, you mean bisexual,’ Sandy said, ‘Yeah,’ the woman said, ‘AC–DC.’"
